# sent_id = STS-Oct-M117-Marks-8
# text = I do this, I suppose, for several reasons: like Gale (and Traweek?), I am truly fascinated by the science here, and enjoy thinking about it; like Edwards and others, I think that this community is generally extremely insular--in Fuller's sense-- they operate in a community where until recently (recently for a historian) no one has ever questioned much less challenged what it is they do, and that it is worthwhile to be an outsider in the community, bringing in metholodigcal, political and social perspectives and questions which they might not choose to ask.
