# sent_id = STS-Oct-M125-Marks-18
# text = Now I've probably missed a few analytical steps along the way, which is why I washed out in philosophy, but if you'll cut me a little slack, Steve, could you explain to me where you think we should be/are with relation to the Englightenment project, and if we are/should be somewhere around where Neitzsche left us [and I honestly don't see that the post-modernist/deconstructionist footnote to Nietzsche has moved us much beyond this, thought the feminist project has covered new ground], on what basis is political community/authority constructed?
